  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div><p>Prior to January 1, 2008, fishing divisions were administrative units to manage, monitor, assess and regulate recreational fisheries. Each zone was based on angler usage and ecological/geographic patterns. Refer to <a href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/fisheries-management-zone' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Fisheries Management Zone for boundaries after 2008.</a></p></div><div><br /></div><div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div><div>Completed: production of the data has been completed<br /></div><div><br /></div><div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div><div>Not planned: there are no plans to update the data<br /></div><div><br /></div><div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div><div>Mae Rannells-Warren, Fisheries Section, Fish and Wildlife Policy Branch, <a href='mailto:mae.rannells-warren@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>mae.rannells-warren@ontario.ca</a></div>"
